 ## Overview
-This method implements the Amanatides–Woo grid traversal algorithm using 32-bit signed integers with 8 fractional bits (Q24.8 fixed-point arithmetic) to determine the sequence of grid cells intersected by a line segment [S1, unofficial]. It builds on [Amanatides–Woo grid traversal](5003-amanatides-woo-grid-traversal.md) by replacing floating-point operations with integer arithmetic to improve performance and avoid floating-point precision issues on specific hardware, while maintaining the same logical structure of stepping through cells based on t-max values.
